.TH INOTIFY_RM_WATCH 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
inotify_rm_watch \- Linux x86-64 syscall 255
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_220_259.h>
.B int inotify_rm_watch(int descriptor, int watch);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Removes an inotify watch.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR inotify_rm_watch (2)
